e,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117355","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117355.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117355.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-19T15:24:14Z"},"body":"Follows the recommendations from https://developer.android.com/games/develop/vulkan/native-engine-support#recommendations\r\n\r\nThis bumps the min supported SDK for the Android editor in order to match the minimum requirements for vulkan support. It also updates the Android editor manifest to require vulkan hardware level 1, and vulkan version 1.1.\r\n\r\nFor the Android export templates, this also bumps the requirement to vulkan version 1.1 when `fallback_to_opengl3` is disabled. When `fallback_to_opengl3` is enabled, vulkan version 1.1 support is made optional. \r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/priv